        "TileImage": "$($repository 0771273c-2ea6-4d2b-a636-409925f626c9).Image",
        "Description": "Sierra Knox, daughter of Robert Knox and racer for Kronstadt, is worried that she cannot secure first place. The expected winner for the race, Moses Lee, should be taken out, preferably before the race ends.\rSierra has also gotten word that in the event that she wins the race, Lee&apos;s sponsors have put a hit on her head. The hitman designated for the job, Johnattan Kindane, is undercover as a street performer until he recieves notice that his contract should be executed.\rEliminate both targets.",
